+			    That hazard lives at occupancy 12, which is CMDOUT -- so
+			    a guard keyed on the PHASE never suppresses there and
+			    cannot reach it.  A guard keyed on the FLAG alone matches
+			    CDB collection too and re-arms #477's objection in full.
+
+			    THIS GUARD IS NOT SELF-CONTAINED, and that is recorded
